Test: Field assignment with custom OFS
--------------------------------------
OFS set to ':'

Before assignment:
  $0 = a b c
  $2 = b
After $2 = "modified":
  $0 = a:modified:c
  $2 = modified

Before assignment:
  $0 = 10 20 30
  $2 = 20
After $2 = "modified":
  $0 = 10:modified:30
  $2 = modified

